					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1118714#post-2236881</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1118714/excerpts-from-the-medical-tragedy-of-dr-bartholomew-artz-aut#post-2236881</link>
