						 <p>Take one guess as to what the thing I'm reimagining is. That's right, it's <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2000">SCP-2000</a>, which causes a zombie apocalypse by-</p> <p>Nah, just kidding. It's the Plague Doctor, made into an Elizabethan play, in which he instigates an Elizabethan Zombie Apocalypse. Yes, seriously.</p> <p>Anyway. Thanks to everyone who read this on chat, and <em>holy crap so much thanks</em> to Kestin, who helped <em>a lot</em> with getting the concept of Iambic Pentameter through my skull so the sonnets were authentic.</p> <p>Please enjoy!</p> 
